\";s:13:\"fade-out-down\";s:40:\"settings_page_transitions_exit_animation\";s:13:\"fade-in-right\";s:25:\"mobile_browser_background\";s:7:\"#FBF5F1\";s:15:\"container_width\";a:3:{s:4:\"unit\";s:2:\"px\";s:4:\"size\";i:960;s:5:\"sizes\";a:0:{}}}'),
