(3037, 275, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"4049622\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/images.pexels.com\\/photos\\/37121086\\/pexels-photo-37121086.jpeg\",\"id\":\"\",\"size\":\"\",\"source\":\"url\"},\"css_classes\":\"ch-banner\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f161542\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Nosotros\",\"_css_classes\":\"ch-titulo-claro\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=6ea55e0\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"ef4652e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"259f962\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>CHICHA naci\\u00f3 de una idea simple: que la cocina del altiplano se cuente con sus historias. Cada plato de nuestra carta rescata una receta de Puno, Cusco o Arequipa y la prepara con t\\u00e9cnicas actuales.<\\/p>\",\"column_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"start\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"bd248c2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9c4143f\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ae188f3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/restaurante\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/10\\/grain-plant-on-square-background_icon-icons.com_70477.svg\",\"id\":210},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"shape\":\"square\",\"title_text\":\"Ra\\u00edz andina\",\"description_text\":\"Ingredientes nativos de productores locales.\",\"icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":85,\"sizes\":[]},\"rotate\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon-box\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"c0aa913\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\"},