f=\"http://localhost/restaurante/mi-reserva/\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/10127261/pexels-photo-10127261.jpeg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/mi-reserva/\">Mi reserva</a></h3><p>Consulta tu comprobante con tu código.\n  _</p>										<a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/carta/\">\n									VER MI RESERVA\n					</a>\n									<h2>Galería</h2>							\n			<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"3952831\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"pexels-fernando-b-m-3624021-30924602\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE0LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL3Jlc3RhdXJhbnRlXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI2XC8xMFwvcGV4ZWxzLWZlcm5hbmRvLWItbS0zNjI0MDIxLTMwOTI0NjAyLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjM5NTI4MzEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/restaurante/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pexels-fernando-b-m-3624021-30924602.jpg\'><img width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"http://localhost/restaurante/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pexels-fernando-b-m-3624021-30924602.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"3952831\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"pexels-christopher-welsch-leveroni-2150186467-34572821\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE2LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL3Jlc3RhdXJhbnRlXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI2XC8xMFwvcGV4ZWxzLWNocmlzdG9waGVyLXdlbHNjaC1sZXZlcm9uaS0yMTUwMTg2NDY3LTM0NTcyODIxLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjM5NTI4MzEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/restaurante/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pexels-christopher-welsch-leveroni-2150186467-34572821.jpg\'><img width=\"800\" height=\"1000\" src=\"http://localhost/restaurante/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pexels-christopher-welsch-leveroni-2150186467-3457