(217, 1, '2026-10-04 21:34:31', '2026-10-05 02:34:31', '<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://localhost/restaurante/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/logo-chicha-circular.svg\" alt=\"\" />													<p>¿Ya hiciste tu reserva?</p>								<a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/mi-reserva/\">\n									SÍ, YA RESERVÉ\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/menu/\">\n									NO, AÚN NO\n					</a>\n						<p>HORARIO DE ATENCIÓN: 12:00 PM – 10:30 PM</p>			<h2>Nuestra filosofía</h2>					<h2>Mikuy</h2>					<h4>Ingredientes</h4>		<p>Trucha, alpaca y papas nativas de productores del altiplano, siempre de temporada.</p>			<h2>Sara</h2>					<h4>Maiz</h4>		<p>El maíz morado y el choclo están en nuestras salsas, bebidas y guarniciones.</p>			<h2>Nina</h2>					<h4>Fuego</h4>		<p>Cocciones lentas y parrilla controlada para lograr sabores profundos.</p>			<h2>Ayni</h2>					<h4>Atención</h4>		<p>Reservar y pagar es simple: sin filas y con comprobante digital.</p>			<h1>Cocina andina, contada con historia</h1>					<h2>Elige tu experiencia</h2>					<figure><a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/carta/\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/39035468/pexels-photo-39035468.jpeg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/carta/\">Carta</a></h3><p>Cuatro platos de autor, cada uno con su historia.</p>										<a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/carta/\">\n									VER CARTA\n					</a>\n									<figure><a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/reserva/\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/36605437/pexels-photo-36605437.jpeg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/reserva/\">Reserva</a></h3><p>Elige día, hora y mesa en el croquis del local.</p>										<a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/carta/\">\n									RESERVAR MESA\n					</a>\n									<figure><a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/mi-reserva/\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/10127261/pexels-photo-10127261.jpeg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></figure><h3><a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/mi-reserva/\">Mi reserva</a></h3><p>Consulta tu comprobante con tu código.\n  _</p>										<a href=\"http://localhost/restaurante/carta/\">\n									VER MI RESERVA\n					</a>\n									<h2>Galería</h2>							\n			<figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"3952831\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"pexels-fernando-b-m-3624021-30924602\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE0LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL3Jlc3RhdXJhbnRlXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI2XC8xMFwvcGV4ZWxzLWZlcm5hbmRvLWItbS0zNjI0MDIxLTMwOTI0NjAyLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjM5NTI4MzEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/restaurante/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pexels-fernando-b-m-3624021-30924602.jpg\'><img width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"http://localhost/restaurante/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pexels-fernando-b-m-3624021-30924602.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n			</figure><figure class=\'gallery-item\'>\n				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox=\"yes\" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow=\"3952831\" data-elementor-lightbox-title=\"pexels-christopher-welsch-leveroni-2150186467-34572821\" data-e-action-hash=\"#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6MTE2LCJ1cmwiOiJodHRwOlwvXC9sb2NhbGhvc3RcL3Jlc3RhdXJhbnRlXC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI2XC8xMFwvcGV4ZWxzLWNocmlzdG9waGVyLXdlbHNjaC1sZXZlcm9uaS0yMTUwMTg2NDY3LTM0NTcyODIxLmpwZyIsInNsaWRlc2hvdyI6IjM5NTI4MzEifQ%3D%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/restaurante/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pexels-christopher-welsch-leveroni-2150186467-34572821.jpg\'><img width=\"800\" height=\"1000\" src=\"http://localhost/restaurante/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pexels-christopher-welsch-leveroni-2150186467-34572821.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" /></a>\n	